From 773fbfcb28429c23cc48877e7cace02203eb7d46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:41:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] marvell: gbsyncd phy add docker-gbsyncd-mrvl component

Add Marvell Prestera external-PHY gbsyncd support.

PHYs are driven by a separate gbsyncd container (syncd -g 1, GB_ASIC_DB) using the
same mrvllibsai/libsai.so as main syncd, with gearbox_config.json, context_config.json,
and per-PHY hwsku JSON. Build with INCLUDE_GBSYNCD=y.

Add platform/components/docker-gbsyncd-mrvl image.

Signed-off-by: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
---
 platform/components/docker-gbsyncd-mrvl.dep   | 12 ++++
 platform/components/docker-gbsyncd-mrvl.mk    | 11 ++++
 .../docker-gbsyncd-mrvl/Dockerfile.j2         | 35 ++++++++++++
 .../docker-gbsyncd-mrvl/critical_processes.j2 |  1 +
 .../docker-gbsyncd-mrvl/docker-init.sh        | 16 ++++++
 .../components/docker-gbsyncd-mrvl/start.sh   | 16 ++++++
 .../docker-gbsyncd-mrvl/supervisord.conf.j2   | 56 +++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 147 insertions(+)
